## What the devil sees in the menu: exactly what the clause does.

devil-clause-desc-soulownership = Their soul becomes yours. You gain a soul, and when they die they are dragged to hell.
devil-clause-desc-weakness = They take half damage from everything, but holy power burns them more.
devil-clause-desc-fearoffire = They can no longer be burned by heat or fire.
devil-clause-desc-brokeness = A pair of autographed designer sneakers appears in their hands.
devil-clause-desc-slaughter = A bottle of blood appears in their hands. Breaking it summons a slaughter demon.
devil-clause-desc-fearofdeath = They never fall into critical condition. They keep standing until the moment they die.
devil-clause-desc-fearoflight = Flashes can no longer blind them.
devil-clause-desc-fearofelectricity = Electric shocks can no longer hurt them.
devil-clause-desc-gluttony = They never need to eat or drink again.
devil-clause-desc-fearofdrowning = They no longer need to breathe.
devil-clause-desc-fearofclowns = They can no longer slip on anything.
devil-clause-desc-fearofcrushing = They become immune to high and low pressure.
devil-clause-desc-fearoffreezing = They can no longer be hurt by the cold.
devil-clause-desc-greed = A fortune of 30,000 spesos appears in their hands.
devil-clause-desc-pain = They no longer feel pain, and wounds no longer slow them down.
devil-clause-desc-chance = They receive one completely random clause, good or bad.
devil-clause-desc-shadows = They fade from sight while standing still.
devil-clause-desc-humanity = They are turned into a rat for 10 minutes. If the rat survives, they return to normal.
devil-clause-desc-strength = They take double damage from everything.
devil-clause-desc-mimes = They learn to raise an invisible wall, like a mime.
devil-clause-desc-diseases = Curses can't touch them, and they fight off diseases much faster.
devil-clause-desc-willtofight = They can never harm anyone again.
devil-clause-desc-buckling = They can never be buckled into a chair or bed again.
devil-clause-desc-mass = They can't be dragged, and can't hide inside lockers or crates.
devil-clause-desc-sight = They are permanently blinded.
devil-clause-desc-tardiness = They move noticeably faster.
devil-clause-desc-foreigners = They understand and speak every language.
devil-clause-desc-intelligence = Their speech turns to gibberish and they become clumsy.
devil-clause-desc-coherence = They speak backwards and become clumsy.
devil-clause-desc-voice = They are permanently mute.
devil-clause-desc-aleg = One of their legs is torn off, and can never be reattached.
devil-clause-desc-weight = They shrink to a tiny fraction of their size.
devil-clause-desc-belittling = They grow to five times their size, and every step booms.
devil-clause-desc-ahand = One of their hands is torn off, and can never be reattached.
devil-clause-desc-handshakes = Both of their arms are torn off for good.
devil-clause-desc-awake = They randomly fall asleep every 5 to 10 minutes.
devil-clause-desc-anorgan = One of their organs is torn out and dropped on the floor. Usually the heart.
devil-clause-desc-legs = Their legs are permanently paralyzed.
devil-clause-desc-innerpeace = They can only move one whole tile at a time.
devil-clause-desc-death = The next time they die, they rise again once.
devil-clause-desc-time = They die 10 minutes after signing, and nothing can bring them back.

## What the mortal reads on the contract.

devil-clause-contract-soulownership = The Contractee's soul passes into the keeping of the Contractor, now and forever.
devil-clause-contract-weakness = The Contractee's flesh shall turn aside half of every blow, though holy light shall sear it all the more.
devil-clause-contract-fearoffire = No flame nor heat shall ever burn the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-brokeness = The Contractee shall receive footwear fit for a legend.
devil-clause-contract-slaughter = The Contractee shall receive a vessel of blood that calls forth a hunter from below.
devil-clause-contract-fearofdeath = The Contractee shall never fall. They stand until their final breath.
devil-clause-contract-fearoflight = No light shall ever blind the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-fearofelectricity = Lightning shall pass through the Contractee as through stone.
devil-clause-contract-gluttony = The Contractee shall never again know hunger or thirst.
devil-clause-contract-fearofdrowning = The Contractee shall live without breath.
devil-clause-contract-fearofclowns = The Contractee's footing shall never fail them.
devil-clause-contract-fearofcrushing = Neither the void nor the deep shall crush the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-fearoffreezing = No cold shall ever reach the Contractee's bones.
devil-clause-contract-greed = The Contractee shall receive wealth beyond counting.
devil-clause-contract-pain = The Contractee shall never again know pain.
devil-clause-contract-chance = The Contractee accepts one term chosen by fate, sight unseen.
devil-clause-contract-shadows = The shadows shall hide the Contractee whenever they are still.
devil-clause-contract-humanity = The Contractee shall wear the shape of vermin for a time, and return only if they survive it.
devil-clause-contract-strength = The Contractee's flesh shall break twice as easily.
devil-clause-contract-mimes = The Contractee shall command walls no one can see.
devil-clause-contract-diseases = No curse nor plague shall take hold of the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-willtofight = The Contractee shall never again raise a hand in anger.
devil-clause-contract-buckling = No seat nor bed shall ever hold the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-mass = The Contractee can be neither moved nor hidden away.
devil-clause-contract-sight = The Contractee surrenders their sight.
devil-clause-contract-tardiness = The Contractee shall never again be late.
devil-clause-contract-foreigners = Every tongue shall be known to the Contractee.
devil-clause-contract-intelligence = The Contractee surrenders their wits.
devil-clause-contract-coherence = The Contractee's words and hands shall turn against them.
devil-clause-contract-voice = The Contractee surrenders their voice.
devil-clause-contract-aleg = The Contractee surrenders one leg, never to be restored.
devil-clause-contract-weight = The Contractee shall become small in all things.
devil-clause-contract-belittling = The Contractee shall tower over all others.
devil-clause-contract-ahand = The Contractee surrenders one hand, never to be restored.
devil-clause-contract-handshakes = The Contractee surrenders both arms, never to be restored.
devil-clause-contract-awake = The Contractee surrenders their waking hours to sudden sleep.
devil-clause-contract-anorgan = The Contractee surrenders a piece of their insides.
devil-clause-contract-legs = The Contractee surrenders the use of their legs.
devil-clause-contract-innerpeace = The Contractee shall walk only in measured steps.
devil-clause-contract-death = The Contractee is granted one escape from death.
devil-clause-contract-time = The Contractee's remaining time is set at ten minutes. Not one second more.
